  <header class="eng-detail-head eng-green"><div><div class="eyebrow">FLAGSHIP PROJECT · HSE-11</div><h1>Integrated Identity &amp; Endpoint Security Capstone</h1><p>Connect identity, endpoint and detection in one defensible security investigation with technical control improvement.</p></div><div class="eng-detail-status"><span class="pill planned">Planned</span><small>No HSE execution evidence yet</small></div></header>
  <div class="eng-detail-layout"><div class="eng-detail-sections">
  <section><span class="eng-section-no">01</span><h2>Security challenge</h2><p>A single dashboard or alert does not reveal how identity, endpoint security and incident response work together.</p></section>
  <section><span class="eng-section-no">02</span><h2>Proposed approach</h2><p>Design a synthetic incident, document evidence sources and engineering decisions, and validate a limited control where feasible.</p></section>
  <section><span class="eng-section-no">03</span><h2>Validation plan (not performed)</h2><dl class="eng-checks"><dt>Positive test</dt><dd>A testable incident timeline supports at least one justified control improvement, independently verified where possible.</dd><dt>Negative test</dt><dd>Missing logs or a non-applicable policy expose a measurable detection or mitigation limitation.</dd><dt>Required evidence</dt><dd>Architecture, timeline, data provenance, test matrix, recovery plan and residual risk.</dd></dl></section>
  <section><span class="eng-section-no">04</span><h2>Evidence boundaries</h2><p>Future capstone; no incident findings or implemented controls are claimed.</p><p>These are acceptance criteria, not observed test results.</p></section>
  </div><aside class="eng-side"><div class="eng-side-panel"><strong>CURRENT STATE</strong><p>Planned · not started</p><strong>PREREQUISITES</strong><p>Independent evidence from HSE-01 and HSE-02 plus a supporting vulnerability or detection case.</p><strong>PUBLICATION GATE</strong><p>Private lab evidence requires human review and sanitization before public release.</p></div><a class="text-link" href="index.html">← Back to projects</a></aside></div></div></main><noscript><p class="shell">All content is available without JavaScript. JavaScript enables the interactive search and filters.</p></noscript><footer id="footer"><div class="shell footer"><span>© Jeroen · Security Engineering · Manually reviewed public portfolio content</span><div><a href="../../../en/roadmap/index.html">Learning roadmap</a><span aria-hidden="true"> · </span><a href="../../../en/contact/index.html">Contact</a></div></div></footer><script defer="" src="../../../assets/dashboard.js"></script></body></html>